══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
GRIMÓRIO DO AFTY · tema "SEIS OLHOS" (Satoru Gojo) — v2 corrigida
Direção de arte: céu de verão, nuvem branca, cabelo neve, o ciano do olho.

REGRA 60 / 30 / 10
60% BRANCO NEVE ... corpo, cartões e pastilhas. A maior área.
30% AZUL CÉU ...... a faixa fixa do topo, bordas e tintas de apoio.
10% AZUL SEIS OLHOS aba ativa, foco, roláveis, glow.
+ trio canônico PE = Azul · PV = Vermelho · Alma = Roxo

POR QUE :scope:not(#nao-existe):
a ficha declara a paleta do modo escuro num seletor mais específico que
#afty-ficha. :not(#id) empresta peso de ID sem repetir o id da raiz,
então o tema vence a paleta nativa e para de depender do modo claro/escuro.

POR QUE COR LITERAL:
toda superfície e todo texto crítico levam cor fixa, não var(). Se a
ficha reescrever as variáveis, o tema continua de pé.
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

@keyframes afty-seis-olhos {
0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(18, 163, 232, 0.45); }
70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(18, 163, 232, 0); }
100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(18, 163, 232, 0.25); }
}

:scope:not(#nao-existe) {

/* ---- tokens do contrato, para o que o tema não alcança ---- */
--afty-fundo: 
#e9f2fa;
--afty-fundo-brilho:
radial-gradient(120% 62% at 50% -14%, rgba(124, 196, 234, 0.5), transparent 68%),
radial-gradient(56% 32% at 84% 6%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9), transparent 70%);
--afty-card: 
#ffffff;
--afty-poco: 
#f3f8fd;
--afty-borda: 
#d5e6f4;
--afty-borda-forte: 
#aecfe9;
--afty-texto: 
#0b2740;
--afty-texto-suave: 
#4c7594;
--afty-texto-fraco: 
#6b8da6;
--afty-destaque: 
#0b6fb8;
--afty-destaque-texto: 
#085f9e;
--afty-destaque-fundo: rgba(11, 111, 184, 0.12);
--afty-pe: 
#0a80bf;
--afty-pv: 
#c81e45;
--afty-alma: 
#6d3fcc;
--afty-pvtemp: 
#b87c14;
--afty-cura: 
#0d8f63;
--afty-aviso: 
#b8760c;
--afty-veu: rgb(8 38 64 / 0.5);
--afty-raio: 16px;
--afty-raio-peq: 10px;
--afty-sombra:
0 1px 2px rgb(11 60 100 / 0.06),
0 10px 26px -12px rgb(11 60 100 / 0.3);
--afty-fonte: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
--afty-fonte-titulo: "Avenir Next", Futura, "Century Gothic", "Segoe UI", var(--afty-fonte);
--afty-fonte-num: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", "Cascadia Mono", "JetBrains Mono", Consolas, monospace;
--afty-imagem: none;
--afty-imagem-opacidade: 0.18;

/* ---- 60%: a base branca, agora literal ---- */
background-color: 
#e9f2fa;
background-image:
radial-gradient(120% 60% at 50% -14%, rgba(124, 196, 234, 0.55), transparent 68%),
radial-gradient(50% 30% at 86% 8%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9), transparent 70%),
radial-gradient(46% 28% at 12% 22%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75), transparent 72%),
radial-gradient(60% 40% at 72% 78%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55), transparent 74%);
background-repeat: no-repeat;
color: 
#0b2740;
color-scheme: light;
scrollbar-color: 
#b6d6ee transparent;
scrollbar-width: thin;
font-family: var(--afty-fonte);

& main {
background-color: transparent;
color: 
#0b2740;
}

& *::selection {
background: 
#bfe3fa;
color: 
#08283f;
}

& *:focus-visible {
outline: 2px solid 
#0b6fb8;
outline-offset: 2px;
border-radius: 10px;
}

/* REDE DE SEGURANÇA: qualquer texto sem classe .afty-* dentro de uma
superfície clara herda a cor do container em vez da paleta escura. /
& :is(.afty-card, .afty-linha, .afty-vital, .afty-stat, .afty-atributo,
.afty-log, .afty-fontes, .afty-busca, .afty-canal-painel,
.afty-retrato-painel) :not([class="afty-"]) {
color: inherit;
}

/* ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
CABEÇALHO · o CÉU. Gradiente vertical, limpo em tela ultrawide.
Tudo que pousa nele vira nuvem branca.
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

& .afty-cabecalho {
background-color: 
#0f6bb0;
background-image:
radial-gradient(80% 140% at 78% -30%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3), transparent 60%),
radial-gradient(60% 120% at 16% 130%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14), transparent 62%),
linear-gradient(180deg, 
#1a7fc3 0%, 
#1071b8 46%, 
#0a5896 100%);
border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.34);
box-shadow: 0 12px 30px -16px rgb(6 44 78 / 0.55);
color: 
#eef8ff;
}

& .afty-cabecalho[data-afty-compacto="sim"] {
box-shadow: 0 16px 34px -16px rgb(6 44 78 / 0.62);
border-bottom-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
}

& .afty-nome {
font-family: var(--afty-fonte-titulo);
color: 
#ffffff;
letter-spacing: 0.015em;
text-shadow: 0 1px 12px rgba(5, 40, 72, 0.45);
}

/* --- pastilhas: nuvem sólida sobre o céu --- */
& .afty-cabecalho .afty-chip,
& .afty-chip {
background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
background-image: none;
border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
color: 
#0a4f86;
border-radius: 999px;
font-weight: 600;
letter-spacing: 0.02em;
box-shadow: 0 2px 8px -4px rgb(4 40 72 / 0.55);
}

& .afty-cabecalho .afty-chip[data-afty-tom="destaque"] {
background-color: 
#ffffff;
color: 
#0b6fb8;
box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(11, 111, 184, 0.3), 0 2px 10px -4px rgb(4 40 72 / 0.5);
}

& .afty-cabecalho .afty-chip[data-afty-tom="aviso"] {
background-color: 
#fff6e3;
color: 
#8a5606;
border-color: 
#f5dcae;
}

/* --- controles do topo --- */
& .afty-cabecalho .afty-controles .afty-botao,
& .afty-cabecalho .afty-botao,
& .afty-cabecalho .afty-passo,
& .afty-cabecalho .afty-campo {
background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
background-image: none;
border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
color: 
#0a4f86;
border-radius: 10px;
-webkit-text-fill-color: currentColor;
}

& .afty-cabecalho .afty-botao:hover,
& .afty-cabecalho .afty-passo:hover {
background-color: 
#ffffff;
color: 
#0b6fb8;
border-color: 
#ffffff;
}

& .afty-cabecalho .afty-botao[data-afty-tom="destaque"] {
background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, 
#ffffff, 
#e9f4ff);
color: 
#0b6fb8;
}

& .afty-retrato-painel {
background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
border-radius: 16px;
color: 
#0b2740;
box-shadow: 0 10px 26px -14px rgb(4 40 72 / 0.75);
}

& .afty-retrato {
border-radius: 12px;
}

/* ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
RECURSOS · Azul, Vermelho e Roxo. Barras com cor literal, sempre visíveis.
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

& .afty-vital {
background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
background-image: none;
border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
border-radius: 16px;
color: 
#0b2740;
box-shadow: 0 8px 22px -14px rgb(4 40 72 / 0.8);
}

& .afty-vital[data-afty-vital="pv"] { box-shadow: inset 0 3px 0 
#c81e45, 0 8px 22px -14px rgb(4 40 72 / 0.8); }
& .afty-vital[data-afty-vital="pe"] { box-shadow: inset 0 3px 0 
#0a80bf, 0 8px 22px -14px rgb(4 40 72 / 0.8); }
& .afty-vital[data-afty-vital="alma"] { box-shadow: inset 0 3px 0 
#6d3fcc, 0 8px 22px -14px rgb(4 40 72 / 0.8); }

& .afty-vital-rotulo {
color: 
#4c7594;
text-transform: uppercase;
letter-spacing: 0.1em;
font-weight: 700;
}

& .afty-vital-icone {
color: 
#5b83a2;
opacity: 1;
}

& .afty-vital-numero {
font-family: var(--afty-fonte-num);
font-weight: 700;
font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
background-color: transparent;
border-color: transparent;
border-radius: 10px;
color: 
#0b2740;
-webkit-text-fill-color: currentColor;
}

& .afty-vital[data-afty-vital="pv"] .afty-vital-numero { color: 
#c81e45; }
& .afty-vital[data-afty-vital="pe"] .afty-vital-numero { color: 
#0a72ab; }
& .afty-vital[data-afty-vital="alma"] .afty-vital-numero { color: 
#6d3fcc; }

& .afty-vital-numero:hover {
background-color: 
#eef7fd;
}

& .afty-vital-max {
color: 
#6b8da6;
font-family: var(--afty-fonte-num);
}

& .afty-vital-temp {
color: 
#a86f10;
font-family: var(--afty-fonte-num);
font-weight: 700;
}

& .afty-vital-trilho {
background-color: 
#dbe9f4;
background-image: none;
border-radius: 999px;
box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgb(11 60 100 / 0.16);
}

& .afty-vital-barra {
border-radius: 999px;
background-color: 
#0a80bf;
transition: width 0.35s ease;
}

& [data-afty-vital="pv"] .afty-vital-barra {
background-color: 
#d1214a;
background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, 
#ef4a71, 
#d1214a);
}

& [data-afty-vital="pe"] .afty-vital-barra {
background-color: 
#0a80bf;
background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, 
#38b6ec, 
#0a80bf);
}

& [data-afty-vital="alma"] .afty-vital-barra {
background-color: 
#7a49d6;
background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, 
#a583ea, 
#7a49d6);
}

& .afty-vital-barra[data-afty-vital="pvtemp"],
& .afty-vital-temp + .afty-vital-trilho .afty-vital-barra {
background-color: 
#d8a11f;
}

& .afty-vital[data-afty-nivel="baixo"] {
background-color: 
#fffcf5;
box-shadow: inset 0 3px 0 
#c1861a, 0 8px 22px -14px rgb(4 40 72 / 0.8);
}

& .afty-vital[data-afty-nivel="critico"] {
background-color: 
#fff5f7;
box-shadow: inset 0 3px 0 
#d1214a, 0 0 0 1px rgba(209, 33, 74, 0.4), 0 8px 22px -14px rgb(4 40 72 / 0.8);
}

/* ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
DEFESAS · os números tinham sumido. Cor literal resolve.
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

& .afty-stat {
background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
background-image: none;
border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
border-radius: 10px;
color: 
#0b2740;
transition: background-color 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease;
}

& .afty-stat:hover {
background-color: 
#ffffff;
transform: translateY(-1px);
}

& .afty-stat-rotulo {
color: 
#4c7594;
text-transform: uppercase;
letter-spacing: 0.08em;
font-weight: 700;
}

& .afty-stat-valor {
font-family: var(--afty-fonte-num);
font-weight: 700;
font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
color: 
#0b2740;
}

& .afty-stat[data-afty-stat="defesa"],
& .afty-stat[data-afty-stat="cd"] {
background-color: 
#ffffff;
box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(11, 111, 184, 0.22);
}

& .afty-stat[data-afty-stat="defesa"] .afty-stat-valor,
& .afty-stat[data-afty-stat="cd"] .afty-stat-valor {
color: 
#0b6fb8;
}

/* ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
ABAS
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

& .afty-abas {
border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);
gap: 0.35rem;
}

& .afty-aba {
color: 
#eaf6ff;
background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
background-image: none;
border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
font-family: var(--afty-fonte-titulo);
font-weight: 600;
letter-spacing: 0.05em;
text-transform: uppercase;
transition: background-color 0.18s ease, color 0.18s ease;
}

& .afty-aba:hover {
background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
color: 
#ffffff;
}

& .afty-aba[aria-selected="true"] {
background-color: 
#ffffff;
color: 
#0b6fb8;
border-color: 
#ffffff;
box-shadow: 0 -2px 14px -4px rgb(255 255 255 / 0.7);
}

/* ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
CORPO · a neve. Onde o jogador vive.
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

& .afty-card {
background-color: 
#ffffff;
background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, 
#ffffff 0%, 
#fbfdff 100%);
border: 1px solid 
#d5e6f4;
border-radius: 16px;
color: 
#0b2740;
box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgb(11 60 100 / 0.06), 0 10px 26px -12px rgb(11 60 100 / 0.3);
transition: border-color 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease;
}

& .afty-card:hover {
border-color: 
#bfdcf1;
box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgb(11 60 100 / 0.06), 0 14px 30px -14px rgb(11 60 100 / 0.34);
}

& .afty-card-titulo {
display: flex;
align-items: center;
gap: 0.55rem;
font-family: var(--afty-fonte-titulo);
font-weight: 700;
text-transform: uppercase;
letter-spacing: 0.09em;
color: 
#0d3453;
border-bottom: 1px solid 
#d5e6f4;
padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

& .afty-card-titulo::before {
content: "";
flex: 0 0 auto;
width: 5px;
height: 1.05em;
border-radius: 999px;
background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, 
#12a3e8, 
#0b6fb8);
box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(18, 163, 232, 0.5);
}

/* --- linhas --- */
& .afty-linha {
background-color: 
#f3f8fd;
background-image: none;
border: 1px solid 
#e4eff9;
border-radius: 10px;
color: 
#0b2740;
transition: background-color 0.16s ease, border-color 0.16s ease, box-shadow 0.16s ease;
}

& .afty-linha:hover {
background-color: 
#eaf4fd;
border-color: 
#c3ddf3;
box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 
#0b6fb8;
}

& .afty-linha[data-afty-destacada="sim"] {
background-color: 
#eff8ff;
background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, 
#f4faff, 
#e8f4fe);
border-color: rgba(11, 111, 184, 0.35);
box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 
#0b6fb8;
}

& .afty-linha[data-afty-alvo="sim"] {
border-color: 
#12a3e8;
box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(18, 163, 232, 0.25);
animation: afty-seis-olhos 1.4s ease-out 2;
}

& .afty-rotulo,
& .afty-linha .afty-rotulo {
color: 
#4c7594;
letter-spacing: 0.01em;
}

& .afty-valor,
& .afty-linha .afty-valor {
font-family: var(--afty-fonte-num);
font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
font-weight: 600;
color: 
#0b2740;
}

& .afty-linha .afty-valor[data-afty-tom="dano"] { color: 
#c81e45; }
& .afty-linha .afty-valor[data-afty-tom="cura"] { color: 
#0d8f63; }
& .afty-linha .afty-valor[data-afty-tom="custo"] { color: 
#0a72ab; }
& .afty-linha .afty-valor[data-afty-tom="aviso"] { color: 
#a86f10; }
& .afty-linha .afty-valor[data-afty-tom="destaque"] { color: 
#0b6fb8; }

/* --- rolável: o único elemento que acende --- */
& .afty-rolavel,
& .afty-linha .afty-rolavel {
color: 
#0b6fb8;
background-color: 
#e4f1fb;
background-image: none;
border: 1px solid rgba(11, 111, 184, 0.3);
border-radius: 999px;
padding: 0.05em 0.5em;
cursor: pointer;
transition: background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
}

& .afty-rolavel:hover,
& .afty-linha .afty-rolavel:hover {
background-color: 
#0b6fb8;
background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, 
#1c8fd6, 
#0b6fb8);
border-color: 
#0b6fb8;
color: 
#ffffff;
box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(18, 163, 232, 0.18);
}

& .afty-rolavel:active {
transform: translateY(1px);
}

/* --- texto de regra --- */
& .afty-texto {
color: 
#33566f;
background-color: 
#f6fbfe;
background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, 
#f8fcff, 
#f1f8fd);
border-left: 3px solid 
#bcdcf2;
border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem;
line-height: 1.62;
}

& .afty-opcao {
background-color: 
#e6f2fc;
border: 1px solid rgba(11, 111, 184, 0.28);
border-radius: 10px;
color: 
#085f9e;
font-weight: 600;
}

& .afty-vazio {
color: 
#6b8da6;
font-style: italic;
}

& .afty-estrela {
color: 
#94b2c7;
transition: color 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
}

& .afty-estrela:hover {
color: 
#d9a319;
transform: scale(1.12);
}

& .afty-estrela[aria-pressed="true"] {
color: 
#e0a417;
filter: drop-shadow(0 0 5px rgba(224, 164, 23, 0.45));
}

/* ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
ATRIBUTOS E SUBABAS
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

& .afty-atributo {
background-color: 
#ffffff;
background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, 
#ffffff, 
#eef7fd);
border: 1px solid 
#d5e6f4;
border-radius: 16px;
color: 
#0b2740;
box-shadow: 0 6px 16px -12px rgb(11 60 100 / 0.5);
transition: border-color 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease;
}

& .afty-atributo:hover {
border-color: 
#a9d0ea;
transform: translateY(-2px);
}

& .afty-atributo-rotulo {
color: 
#4c7594;
text-transform: uppercase;
letter-spacing: 0.12em;
font-weight: 700;
}

& .afty-atributo-valor {
font-family: var(--afty-fonte-num);
font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
color: 
#0b2740;
}

& .afty-atributo-mod {
font-family: var(--afty-fonte-num);
font-weight: 700;
background-color: 
#0b6fb8;
background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, 
#1c8fd6, 
#0b6fb8);
border: 1px solid 
#0b6fb8;
color: 
#ffffff;
border-radius: 999px;
box-shadow: 0 4px 12px -6px rgba(11, 111, 184, 0.8);
cursor: pointer;
}

& .afty-atributo-mod:hover {
box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(18, 163, 232, 0.22), 0 4px 12px -6px rgba(11, 111, 184, 0.8);
}

& .afty-subabas {
gap: 0.35rem;
border-bottom: 1px solid 
#d5e6f4;
padding-bottom: 0.35rem;
}

& .afty-subaba {
background-color: 
#f1f7fc;
background-image: none;
border: 1px solid 
#d5e6f4;
border-radius: 999px;
color: 
#4c7594;
font-weight: 600;
transition: background-color 0.16s ease, color 0.16s ease, border-color 0.16s ease;
}

& .afty-subaba:hover {
background-color: 
#e6f2fc;
color: 
#085f9e;
border-color: 
#b6d8f0;
}

& .afty-subaba[aria-selected="true"] {
background-color: 
#0b6fb8;
background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, 
#1c8fd6, 
#0b6fb8);
border-color: 
#0b6fb8;
color: 
#ffffff;
box-shadow: 0 4px 14px -8px rgba(11, 111, 184, 0.9);
}

& .afty-subaba-conta {
background-color: rgba(11, 111, 184, 0.12);
color: 
#085f9e;
border-radius: 999px;
font-family: var(--afty-fonte-num);
font-size: 0.85em;
}

& .afty-subaba[aria-selected="true"] .afty-subaba-conta {
background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
color: 
#ffffff;
}

/* ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
CONTROLES DO CORPO
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

& main .afty-botao {
background-color: 
#ffffff;
background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, 
#ffffff, 
#f4f9fd);
border: 1px solid 
#aecfe9;
border-radius: 10px;
color: 
#0b2740;
font-weight: 600;
transition: background-color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
}

& main .afty-botao:hover {
